OL,3,GNEWSAGurkhas set to be awarded Freedom
OL,4,Aof Kent honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe British Army's Brigade of Gurkhas
OL,7,Flooks set to be granted the Freedom of
OL,8,FKent.
OL,10,FThe fighting force has been recommended
OL,11,Fto receive the civic honour at a
OL,12,Fmeeting of Kent County Council (KCC) on
OL,13,FThursday in recognition of "the
OL,14,Fdistinguished service" it has given the
OL,15,FUK over its 216 year history.
OL,17,FOne of its battalions, the 2nd Royal
OL,18,FGurkha Rifles, an air assault infantry
OL,19,Funit, is based at Shornecliffe Barracks
OL,20,Fin Folkestone, while The Queen's Gurkha
OL,21,FEngineers are at Maidstone's Invicta
OL,22,FPark Barracks.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
