OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGurkhas set to be awarded Freedom
OL,4,Aof Kent honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigner Peter Carroll, who fought
OL,7,Ffor five years alongside Absolutely
OL,8,FFabulous star Joanna Lumley to win
OL,9,Frights for ex-Gurkhas to settle in the
OL,10,FUK, said the honour would be "richly
OL,11,Fdeserved".
